 "concept_note": "Concept preview: these pages show how the build manual will look. Pin labels, voltages, connector polarity and dimensions are not verified yet - do not wire from them. The pictured XIAO ESP32-S3 controller runs the Starter Node firmware (choose product type chicken-tender) today; the dedicated Chicken Tender firmware targets an ESP32-WROOM-32.",
